# SEL + a key in the FX menu opens that effect's settings page (not the pattern, as SEL + a key does elsewhere): the gate (G#3), the phaser,
# scatter on the beat page, a Flex pad (and the page shows its bar), a sampler key; an effect with no settings says so.
seed 0
wait 3000
tap FX
wait 100
press SEL
tapkey 5
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 1
tap FX
tap FX
wait 100
press SEL
tapkey 8
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 2
tap FX
tap FX
wait 100
press SEL
tapkey 11
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 0
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
press SEL
tapkey 9
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 9
tap FX
tap FX
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect fxbank 2
press SEL
tapkey 3
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 19
expect flexlast 3
tap FX
tap FX
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
press SEL
tapkey 2
release SEL
wait 100
expect fxpage 20
